Steps to archive and transfer MOM6 output 
Simulation is run outside FRE (not using xml, "manually"
using my job submit script)
After the simulation is completed the output *nc are in the WD
e.g.
/gpfs/f5/cefi/scratch/Dmitry.Dukhovskoy/work/NEP_BGCphys

Want to group output by months, tar, send to pp/anls

cd /ncrc/home1/Dmitry.Dukhovskoy/scripts/MOM6_NEP
1) edit and run arrange_mom_output.sh --> groups output byt year/months
   for daily average MOM6 and SIS2 with output files like:
   19930401.icem_1993_093.nc
   19930401.oceanm_1993_093.nc

   use arrange_momsis_output.sh

2) run archive_mom2ppanls.sh for specified YR (month), edit output directory:
./archive_mom2ppanls.sh 1993 10 
or:
./archive_mom2ppanls.sh 1993 -- for all months in 1993

The script will 
= tar files by months by Nft files in each tar (*nc will be removed 
  if tar succeeds)
= transfer them to pp/anls



